description: Comments stay one line; prefer none when the code is clear
alwaysApply: true
---

# Comments

- Do not write multi-line `//` or `/**` blocks.
- One line max if a comment is needed. Delete it if the name already explains it.
- No narration, history, or "why we used to do X".
- Empty `catch` may omit a comment.

```ts
// ❌
// Session cookies are first-party on the web origin.
// Forward them to the API; do not assume they were issued on the API host.

// ✅
// Forward web cookies to /v1/me.
```
